{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）中午12時51分，一輛電單車沿青衣青康路左二線行駛，至長康邨對開時，與一輛右轉入邨的私家車相撞。</p><p>電單車登時翻倒損毀，姓古（35歲）鐵騎士飛彈地上，擦傷手腳及腰頸痛，稍後由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。私家車司機姓葉38歲沒有受傷，在場受查。</p><figure><img alt=\"救護員為電單車鐵騎士急救。（Facebook「青衣街坊吹水會」圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192848798238380032389642.jpeg/twqxCO2XHJ4KuXLB37MejBLasEs_k5l5kQEtVZEBLVU\"/><figcaption>救護員為電單車鐵騎士急救。（Facebook「青衣街坊吹水會」圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:04:51.585554+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:52:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:39:39.285942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:58.608046+00:00","content_hash":"9a33c4051607f366a69067f6f688cf07b5a33ea1a65e3e4a495edfee8c32484e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}